{'symbol': 'APH', 'date': '2021-04-07 10:31:00', 'title': 'AMPHENOL COMPLETES ACQUISITION OF MTS SYSTEMS', 'text': 'WALLINGFORD, CONN.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--AMPHENOL CORPORATION (NYSE: APH), A LEADING GLOBAL PROVIDER OF HIGH-TECHNOLOGY INTERCONNECT, ANTENNA AND SENSOR SOLUTIONS, TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT IT HAS COMPLETED ITS ACQUISITION OF MTS SYSTEMS CORPORATION (“MTS”). IN CONNECTION WITH THE CLOSE OF THE TRANSACTION, MTS COMMON STOCK WILL CEASE TO TRADE ON THE NASDAQ. “WE ARE EXCITED TO HAVE COMPLETED OUR ACQUISITION OF MTS AND TO WELCOME THE TALENTED MTS TEAM TO THE AMPHENOL FAMILY,” SAID R. ADAM NORWITT, AMPHENO'}